      "created_at": "2012-02-09T22:42:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Keep in mind that some hero draws (the ones that happen at the end of the turn, for instance) are optional.  This basically means that heroes who might not want to shuffle their discards into their decks even if they are out of cards (Tachyon) might not have to.</p>",
